          "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a locally Noetherian scheme. Let <MATH_0002> be an algebraic space\nlocally of finite type over <MATH_0003>. Let <MATH_0004> be a closed\nsubset. Let <MATH_0005> be the open subspace with\n<MATH_0006>. Let <MATH_0007> be a locally Noetherian\nformal algebraic space over <MATH_0008> with <MATH_0009> locally of finite type\nover <MATH_0010>. Finally, we let\n<MATH_0011>\nbe a formal modification, see\nAlgebraization of Formal Spaces, Definition\n<REF_0001>.\nRecall that <MATH_0012> denotes the formal completion of <MATH_0013> along\n<MATH_0014>, see Formal Spaces, Section <REF_0002>.\n<STRUCT_0002>",
